{"seq":1,"slug":"lint-staged-husky","title":"lint-staged 与 Husky 实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/team-ci-integration/lint-staged-husky","wordCount":906,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"lint-staged-与-husky-实战\">lint-staged 与 Husky 实战</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>lint-staged 和 Husky 是前端工程化中实现<strong>提交前代码质量门禁</strong>的核心工具组合。Husky 负责管理 Git Hooks（尤其是 pre-commit 钩子），lint-staged 负责只对 Git 暂存区（staged）的文件运行 lint 和格式化命令。两者配合使得每次提交都经过自动化检查，从源头防止不合规的代码进入仓库。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;git add .&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;git commit&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Husky pre-commit Hook]&#10;    C --&gt; D[lint-staged 执行]&#10;    D --&gt; E[筛选暂存文件]&#10;    E --&gt; F[按 glob 匹配运行命令]&#10;    F --&gt; G[ESLint / Biome --fix]&#10;    F --&gt; H[Prettier --write]&#10;    G --&gt; I{有错误?}&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt;|否| J[提交成功]&#10;    I --&gt;|是| K[中止提交并报错]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"git add .\"] --&gt; B[\"git commit\"]\n    B --&gt; C[Husky pre-commit Hook]\n    C --&gt; D[lint-staged 执行]\n    D --&gt; E[筛选暂存文件]\n    E --&gt; F[按 glob 匹配运行命令]\n    F --&gt; G[ESLint / Biome --fix]\n    F --&gt; H[Prettier --write]\n    G --&gt; I{有错误?}\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt;|否| J[提交成功]\n    I --&gt;|是| K[中止提交并报错]</pre><p>Git Hooks 工具对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Husky</th>\n<th>simple-git-hooks</th>\n<th>lefthook</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实现方式</td>\n<td>npm install 时注入 .husky/</td>\n<td>package.json 配置</td>\n<td>独立二进制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置复杂度</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多 Hook 支持</td>\n<td>每个 Hook 一个文件</td>\n<td>一个配置对象</td>\n<td>YAML 配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行执行</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安装体积</td>\n<td>~100KB</td>\n<td>~10KB</td>\n<td>~5MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI 中跳过</td>\n<td>HUSKY=0</td>\n<td>自动跳过</td>\n<td>LEFTHOOK=0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"husky-配置与-git-hooks\">Husky 配置与 Git Hooks</h2><p>Husky v9 的配置流程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm install -D husky&#10;npx husky init\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -D</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> husky</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> husky</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>npx husky init</code> 会自动完成两件事：在 <code>.husky/</code> 目录创建 <code>pre-commit</code> 脚本，并在 <code>package.json</code> 中添加 <code>prepare</code> 脚本确保团队成员 <code>npm install</code> 后自动激活 Hooks。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;prepare&quot;: &quot;husky&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"prepare\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"husky\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/usr/bin/env sh&#10;# .husky/pre-commit&#10;npx lint-staged\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/usr/bin/env sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .husky/pre-commit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lint-staged</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Husky 还支持其他 Git Hooks：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/usr/bin/env sh&#10;# .husky/commit-msg&#10;npx --no -- commitlint --edit &quot;$1&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/usr/bin/env sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .husky/commit-msg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --no</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commitlint</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --edit</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/usr/bin/env sh&#10;# .husky/pre-push&#10;npm run typecheck&#10;npm run test -- --run\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/usr/bin/env sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .husky/pre-push</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> typecheck</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --run</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hook</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>pre-commit</td>\n<td>commit 前</td>\n<td>lint-staged 代码检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>commit-msg</td>\n<td>提交消息写入后</td>\n<td>commitlint 消息格式检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pre-push</td>\n<td>push 前</td>\n<td>类型检查、单元测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>post-merge</td>\n<td>merge 后</td>\n<td>自动 npm install</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>post-checkout</td>\n<td>checkout 后</td>\n<td>清理缓存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"lint-staged-配置详解\">lint-staged 配置详解</h2><p>lint-staged 的核心价值是<strong>只检查变更的文件</strong>，避免全量扫描的性能浪费。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;lint-staged&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;*.{ts,tsx}&quot;: [&quot;eslint --fix --max-warnings 0&quot;, &quot;prettier --write&quot;],&#10;    &quot;*.{css,scss}&quot;: [&quot;prettier --write&quot;],&#10;    &quot;*.{json,md,yaml}&quot;: [&quot;prettier --write&quot;],&#10;    &quot;*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx}&quot;: [&quot;vitest related --run&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lint-staged\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"*.{ts,tsx}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"eslint --fix --max-warnings 0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prettier --write\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"*.{css,scss}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prettier --write\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"*.{json,md,yaml}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prettier --write\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"vitest related --run\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用 Biome 替代 ESLint + Prettier 时的配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;lint-staged&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx,css,json}&quot;: [&quot;biome check --write --no-errors-on-unmatched&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lint-staged\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx,css,json}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"biome check --write --no-errors-on-unmatched\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>lint-staged 的文件匹配使用 micromatch 库，支持丰富的 glob 模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const lintStagedPatterns = {&#10;  &#39;*.ts&#39;: &#39;匹配根目录的 .ts 文件&#39;,&#10;  &#39;**/*.ts&#39;: &#39;匹配任意深度的 .ts 文件&#39;,&#10;  &#39;src/**/*.{ts,tsx}&#39;: &#39;匹配 src 下的 TS/TSX&#39;,&#10;  &#39;!(*test).ts&#39;: &#39;排除测试文件&#39;,&#10;  &#39;*.{js,mjs,cjs}&#39;: &#39;匹配多种 JS 扩展名&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> lintStagedPatterns</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '*.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'匹配根目录的 .ts 文件'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '**/*.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'匹配任意深度的 .ts 文件'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'src/**/*.{ts,tsx}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'匹配 src 下的 TS/TSX'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '!(*test).ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'排除测试文件'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '*.{js,mjs,cjs}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'匹配多种 JS 扩展名'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[Git 暂存区文件列表] --&gt; B[lint-staged 读取配置]&#10;    B --&gt; C{匹配 glob 模式}&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;*.ts → ESLint + Prettier&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;*.css → Prettier&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;*.json → Prettier&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[串行执行命令]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H{所有命令成功?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[自动 git add 修改后的文件]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[中止提交]&#10;    I --&gt; K[继续 commit 流程]\">flowchart TD\n    A[Git 暂存区文件列表] --&gt; B[lint-staged 读取配置]\n    B --&gt; C{匹配 glob 模式}\n    C --&gt; D[\"*.ts → ESLint + Prettier\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"*.css → Prettier\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"*.json → Prettier\"]\n    D --&gt; G[串行执行命令]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H{所有命令成功?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[自动 git add 修改后的文件]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[中止提交]\n    I --&gt; K[继续 commit 流程]</pre><p>lint-staged 在执行修复命令后会自动将修改后的文件重新添加到暂存区。这意味着 <code>eslint --fix</code> 和 <code>prettier --write</code> 的修改会自动包含在本次提交中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见问题与高级配置\">常见问题与高级配置</h2><p><strong>大文件性能问题</strong>：当暂存区包含大量文件时，lint-staged 可能变慢。可以通过 <code>--concurrent</code> 标志控制并发：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;lint-staged&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;*.ts&quot;: &quot;eslint --fix&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lint-staged\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"*.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"eslint --fix\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>部分暂存文件（Partial Staging）</strong>：当一个文件只有部分内容被暂存时（<code>git add -p</code>），lint-staged 会使用 stash 机制保护未暂存的更改。但 <code>--fix</code> 类操作可能导致冲突。</p>\n<p><strong>跳过 Hooks</strong>：紧急情况下可以跳过 pre-commit 检查：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git commit --no-verify -m &quot;hotfix: urgent patch&quot;&#10;&#10;HUSKY=0 git commit -m &quot;skip hooks&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --no-verify</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"hotfix: urgent patch\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">HUSKY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"skip hooks\"</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Hook 未触发</td>\n<td>.husky/ 未正确安装</td>\n<td>重新运行 npx husky</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>lint-staged 超时</td>\n<td>暂存文件过多</td>\n<td>缩小 glob 范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修复后暂存区不一致</td>\n<td>部分暂存 + --fix 冲突</td>\n<td>避免 partial staging + fix</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI 中 Hook 执行</td>\n<td>CI 不需要 Git Hooks</td>\n<td>设置 HUSKY=0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队成员未安装</td>\n<td>prepare 脚本缺失</td>\n<td>确保 package.json 有 prepare</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>函数式配置</strong>：lint-staged 支持 JavaScript 配置文件，允许根据文件路径动态生成命令：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const config = {&#10;  &#39;*.ts&#39;: (filenames: string[]) =&gt; {&#10;    const files = filenames.join(&#39; &#39;);&#10;    return [`eslint --fix ${files}`, `prettier --write ${files}`, `vitest related --run ${files}`];&#10;  },&#10;  &#39;*.css&#39;: &#39;prettier --write&#39;,&#10;};&#10;&#10;export default config;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '*.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">filenames</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> files</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> filenames.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">' '</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`eslint --fix ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">files</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`prettier --write ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">files</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`vitest related --run ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">files</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '*.css'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'prettier --write'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与-ci-的协同\">与 CI 的协同</h2><p>lint-staged + Husky 解决的是<strong>开发者本地提交前检查</strong>，但不能替代 CI 中的完整检查。两者形成互补的质量保障体系。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查层</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>强制性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>本地 pre-commit</td>\n<td>lint-staged + Husky</td>\n<td>暂存文件</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>可跳过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI lint</td>\n<td>ESLint / Biome</td>\n<td>全量代码</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>不可跳过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI format</td>\n<td>Prettier --check / Biome ci</td>\n<td>全量代码</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>不可跳过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI test</td>\n<td>Vitest / Jest</td>\n<td>全量测试</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>不可跳过</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本地 Hook 是&quot;快速反馈&quot;层，CI 是&quot;最终防线&quot;层。即使开发者使用 <code>--no-verify</code> 跳过了本地检查，CI 仍然会捕获问题并阻止合并。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((lint-staged + Husky))&#10;    Husky&#10;      Git Hooks 管理&#10;      pre-commit 核心&#10;      prepare 自动安装&#10;    lint-staged&#10;      只检查暂存文件&#10;      glob 模式匹配&#10;      串行命令执行&#10;    配置模式&#10;      JSON 简单配置&#10;      JS 函数式配置&#10;      Biome 统一检查&#10;    常见问题&#10;      部分暂存冲突&#10;      大文件性能&#10;      Hook 未触发&#10;    协同策略&#10;      本地快速反馈&#10;      CI 最终防线&#10;      两层质量保障\">mindmap\n  root((lint-staged + Husky))\n    Husky\n      Git Hooks 管理\n      pre-commit 核心\n      prepare 自动安装\n    lint-staged\n      只检查暂存文件\n      glob 模式匹配\n      串行命令执行\n    配置模式\n      JSON 简单配置\n      JS 函数式配置\n      Biome 统一检查\n    常见问题\n      部分暂存冲突\n      大文件性能\n      Hook 未触发\n    协同策略\n      本地快速反馈\n      CI 最终防线\n      两层质量保障</pre><ul>\n<li>Husky 管理 Git Hooks 的注册和分发，lint-staged 负责筛选暂存文件并执行检查命令</li>\n<li>lint-staged 只处理变更文件，避免全量扫描带来的性能浪费</li>\n<li>使用 Biome 时可以简化为单条 <code>biome check --write</code> 命令</li>\n<li>部分暂存文件与 <code>--fix</code> 操作可能产生冲突，需要注意使用场景</li>\n<li>本地 Hooks 和 CI 形成两层质量保障：本地快速反馈，CI 不可绕过的最终防线</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"lint-staged 与 Husky 实战","id":"lint-staged-与-husky-实战"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Husky 配置与 Git Hooks","id":"husky-配置与-git-hooks"},{"level":2,"text":"lint-staged 配置详解","id":"lint-staged-配置详解"},{"level":2,"text":"常见问题与高级配置","id":"常见问题与高级配置"},{"level":2,"text":"与 CI 的协同","id":"与-ci-的协同"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"迁移指南：从 ESLint/Prettier 到新一代工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/next-gen-tools/migration-guide"},"next":{"title":"CI 流水线中的 Lint 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/team-ci-integration/ci-pipeline-lint"}}